    "positive_direction": "Deep ultramarine, warm vermilion and pale ochre form a deliberate gouache painting. Broad matte pigment planes, dry-brush edges inside substantial forms and controlled light/shadow make the caring gesture readable. A large contrast-stroke Korean Title feels painted in rhythm but remains clearly typeset; the body and small information use calm regular sans anatomy, never brush-corrupted glyphs. Paint one observable caring action: a mature hand grips a watering vessel and a short stream lands at the exposed soil, beside upward branching houseplant leaves. Warm hand planes and the red vessel cross the cool blue plant shadows. Use weight-bearing contact, credible wrist and grip, a consistent pouring direction and a stable pot opening, with no cute characters or toy rendering.",
    "native_positive_brief": "Create one finished opaque flat landscape 16:9 poster. Use the supplied newly authored planning guide for actual copy anatomy, readable areas and substantive image contacts; implement the following completed style rather than reproducing its temporary shapes. Deep ultramarine, warm vermilion and pale ochre form a deliberate gouache painting. Broad matte pigment planes, dry-brush edges inside substantial forms and controlled light/shadow make the caring gesture readable. A large contrast-stroke Korean Title feels painted in rhythm but remains clearly typeset; the body and small information use calm regular sans anatomy, never brush-corrupted glyphs. Paint one observable caring action: a mature hand grips a watering vessel and a short stream lands at the exposed soil, beside upward branching houseplant leaves. Warm hand planes and the red vessel cross the cool blue plant shadows. Use weight-bearing contact, credible wrist and grip, a consistent pouring direction and a stable pot opening, with no cute characters or toy rendering. A large, articulated forearm and watering vessel lead into a rooted upright plant at the right; the pour terminates in the soil opening, and the planted vessel has an attached painted shadow. The left Title/body/visit column may share M1’s effective order while retaining a wholly different drawn colour world. The intended feeling is Intimate, vivid and affectionate; tending a plant is an everyday pleasure. Make the supplied main Title immediately recognisable through its broad size, weight/contrast and breathing space. Keep the market line as a subordinate eyebrow, the English name as a smaller companion, and the short explanatory sentence as a clear Subtitle. Keep the entire explanatory paragraph as mature regular body text with stable starts, natural Korean word spaces and meaning-led soft lines. Link its ending to the date/hour/place group, then nearby access/care information, invitation and URL along the same 